  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Preservation_Station?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FPreservation%20Station.png\" title=\"Preservation Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Preservation Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"172\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Preservation Station</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 91</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 950,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  4 d</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 44</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s) slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 89</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Preservation Station</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 91.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/pickles-35178\" title=\"Pickles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pickles</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/canned-fish-35179\" title=\"Canned Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">canned fish</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/kimchi-35180\" title=\"Kimchi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">kimchi</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/dried-fruit-35181\" title=\"Dried Fruit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">dried fruit,</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/guava-compote-35656\" title=\"Guava Compote\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">guava compote</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 950,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 4 days (or 89 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) to build the Preservation Station. It gives players 44 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/pickles-35178\" title=\"Pickles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pickles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/canned-fish-35179\" title=\"Canned fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Canned fish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/kimchi-35180\" title=\"Kimchi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kimchi\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/pickles-35178\" title=\"Pickles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pickles</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/canned-fish-35179\" title=\"Canned Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Canned Fish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/kimchi-35180\" title=\"Kimchi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kimchi</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 91\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 95\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 98\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 h\n</td>\n<td>3 h 40 min\n</td>\n<td>5 h\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 3 h 24 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 3 h 7 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 4 h 15 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>7<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>8<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>270<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>471<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>219<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>56<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>26<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/dried-fruit-35181\" title=\"Dried fruit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dried fruit\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/guava-compote-35656\" title=\"Guava compote\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guava compote\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/dried-fruit-35181\" title=\"Dried Fruit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dried Fruit</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/guava-compote-35656\" title=\"Guava Compote\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Guava Compote</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 102\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 104\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 h\n</td>\n<td>4 h 20 min\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 2 h 33 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 3 h 41 min\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>7<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>266<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>421<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>50<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The Preservation Station originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to completely upgrade their machine.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mastering</b></span></h3>\n<p>A total of 2,180 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Preservation Station:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/76/Preservation_Station_Mastered.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926003533\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mastered Preservation Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastered Preservation Station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"133\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>140 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>410 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>1,630 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Mastery_I.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602234714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery I\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/36/Mastery_II_5.png/revision/latest?cb=20260605002649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery II 5\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FPreservation%20Station%20Mastery.png\" title=\"Special:FilePath/Preservation Station Mastery.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Preservation Station Mastery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>15% faster</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<p>Compared to other late game production machines, the Preservation Station is unusually easy to master as <a href=\"/wiki/kimchi-35180\" title=\"Kimchi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">kimchis</a> only require field products and take 45 hours to finish a full 9-slot queue. <a href=\"/wiki/pickles-35178\" title=\"Pickles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pickles</a> is an alternative if your <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Silo</a> can't handle too much crops.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bath-kiosk-34840\" title=\"Bath Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bath Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cake-oven-3556\" title=\"Cake Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cake Oven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candle-maker-16469\" title=\"Candle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candle Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/coffee-kiosk-3564\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coffee Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cupcake-maker-35636\" title=\"Cupcake Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cupcake Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deep Fryer</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/doner-kebab-stand-36894\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doner Kebab Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Doner Kebab Stand</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/donut-maker-34959\" title=\"Donut Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Donut Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/essential-oils-lab-36027\" title=\"Essential Oils Lab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Essential Oils Lab</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/feed-mill-3546\" title=\"Feed Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feed Mill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flower Shop</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/fondue-pot-32980\" title=\"Fondue Pot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fondue Pot</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/fudge-shop-35377\" title=\"Fudge Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fudge Shop</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/hat-maker-18338\" title=\"Hat Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hat Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/honey-extractor-15755\" title=\"Honey Extractor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Honey Extractor</a>  • <a href=\"/wiki/hot-dog-stand-19439\" title=\"Hot Dog Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hot Dog Stand</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/ice-cream-maker-3560\" title=\"Ice Cream Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ice Cream Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/jam-maker-3561\" title=\"Jam Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jam Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/jeweler-3562\" title=\"Jeweler\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jeweler</a> • <a hre