  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Preservation Station.png|200px|left|Preservation Station|link=Special:FilePath/Preservation_Station.png]]\n\n{{Infobox\n|level = 91\n|price = 950,000\n|time = 4 d\n|xp = 44\n|slots = 2 slot(s)\n|dia = 89\n|title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n|size = 2×2\n}}\nThe '''Preservation Station''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 91.\n\nIt is used to make [[Pickles|pickles]], [[Canned Fish|canned fish]], [[Kimchi|kimchi]], [[Dried Fruit|dried fruit,]] and [[Guava Compote|guava compote]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n=== '''Building''' ===\nIt costs 950,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} and takes 4 days (or 89 {{Infoicon|dia}}) to build the Preservation Station. It gives players 44 {{Infoicon|xp}} when completed.\n----\n=== '''Products''' ===\n{{Building Products\n|Pickles|91|4h/7|270\n|Canned Fish|95|3:40/7|471\n|Kimchi|98|5h/8|219\n|Dried Fruit|102|3h|266\n|Guava Compote|104|4:20|421/50\n}}\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}}\nThe Preservation Station originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 [[diamond]]s. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more {{Infoicon|dia}} than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 {{Infoicon|dia}} to completely upgrade their machine.\n----\n=== '''Mastering''' ===\nA total of 2,180 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Preservation Station:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Preservation Station Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Preservation Station]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />140 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />410 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />1,630 hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10Coins.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM5XP.png|100px|]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Preservation Station Mastery.png|100px|link=Special:FilePath/Preservation_Station_Mastery.png]]\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|coin}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% {{Infoicon|xp}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''15% faster'''\n|}\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\nCompared to other late game production machines, the Preservation Station is unusually easy to master as [[Kimchi|kimchis]] only require field products and take 45 hours to finish a full 9-slot queue. [[Pickles]] is an alternative if your [[Silo]] can't handle too much crops.\n----\n=== '''Did you know?''' ===\n\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Konservierungsstation\n|es = Fábrica de conservas\n|fr = Atelier de Conserves\n|it = Conservificio\n|no = Konserveringsstasjon\n|ru = Консервный завод\n}}\n[[pt-br:Fábrica de conservas]]\n\n[[Category:Production Buildings]]",
  "wikitextHash": "2530c0ed1e024bc9dd060ad703818300c6a4ead5d7a098e8fcb39813ce76904f"
